    "sections": {
        "description": "Sen Business is a flexible, modern, and fully customizable WordPress theme, perfectly crafted for businesses, corporate brands, educational institutions, consultancies, agencies, and a wide range of professional websites. Built with the powerful Elementor page builder, it empowers you to create visually stunning, high-performing websites with ease — no coding required. Sen Business is a versatile and highly customizable WordPress theme built with the powerful Elementor plugin, making it ideal for virtually any type of business website. Featuring a clean and modern design, Sen Business offers extensive customization options, including unlimited color choices, adjustable sidebars, and flexible background settings, allowing you to create a site that aligns perfectly with your brand."
    },
